WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.133
-Finally, guys, it is Tuesday.

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:03.467
It's time for "WeTweet."
Here we go.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:07.067
-♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:08.367
♪♪

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:09.534
♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:11.801
-Welcome to "WeTweet"!

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:14.434
This is where we,
as a group, decide something

00:00:14.434 --> 00:00:16.033
we should post on Twitter.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:17.234
I'm gonna show you
five different tweets,

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:18.300
and we're all gonna vote

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.934
on whether you
like each one or not.

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:21.334
You all have voting clickers
at your seats?

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:24.067
I see people scrambling
for them, sharing them.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:26.701
Everyone has their own,
so it's all gonna be fine.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:28.067
You can vote for all of them,

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.467
you can vote for none of them,
whatever you want,

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.868
and we'll see the results live.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.200
Higgins, you have your clicker?
-Got it.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.667
-All right.
Your thumb's already on no.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:35.934
-Well...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.501
Wanna be positive.
-Why --

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:38.634
-I wanna be positive.
-Yeah, but why --

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.334
-I'm gonna put "no"
on every one.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:41.467
-What? You're gonna say no
to all of them?

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:43.467
-Yep, just so it'll be fair.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:44.934
'Cause Tariq's --
Tariq's gonna go yes --

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:46.834
-Tariq, what are you thinking?
-I voted -- I'm done.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.067
I voted "yes" to everything.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:50.167
-All right. Quest,
I know you're very positive.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.534
You always vote yes.
-Always yes.

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:52.734
-Yes.
-I love my job.

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:55.334
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:56.701
Whatever tweet
gets the most likes,

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.667
we will tweet it out
live on the show,

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.067
so that you can all like it
and "wetweet" it.

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:03.467
-Nice.
-It's a shared experience.

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:06.467
You guys ready for this?
The first tweet is...

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:11.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:14.534
♪♪

00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:17.267
Some people laughing, some
people just stone-- stone-faced.

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:19.634
-Yeah.
-I don't know.

00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:21.801
-Some people don't know they
should -- they shouldn't do --

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:23.234
-Yeah, I don't think
it's gonna work.

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:26.367
The votes are in.
Let's see the results.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.801
-Oh, oh.
-All right, not bad.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:29.767
Not bad. 100...

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.701
Very honest audience.
I like that, yeah.

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.033
-Lot of abstentions.
-Wasn't the -- yeah.

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.100
Wasn't the best,
wasn't the worst.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.534
-Yeah. Wasn't worst.
Was fine.

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:37.167
-Let's see this next one here.
It says...

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:43.734
♪♪

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:45.300
-Come on. That's true.
-That's rare.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.567
-That's fair.
-That's a rare sighting.

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:48.000
-That's a rare baby name
nowadays.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.501
-Yeah, it's like "What --
What's the name of your baby?"

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:50.701
"It's Cheryl."
-"Cheryl."

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:52.167
-Yeah.
-Gladys.

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:54.133
-All right, here we go.
You cast your votes.

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:56.601
Let's see the results.

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:58.534
-Oh!
-Oh, barely better.

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:01.067
♪♪

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:02.634
-"Cheryl" --
-I love that -- barely better.

00:02:02.634 --> 00:02:04.200
We might not even
tweet one out tonight.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.801
Who knows?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.801 --> 00:02:06.868
Next one here says...

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:12.334
Oh, that's interesting.
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:15.667
That one got -- you can't --
you can't boo the jokes.

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:17.234
Just...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:19.267
...thumbs up or thumbs down.
Please no booing.

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:20.434
-'90s George Carlin.
-I don't need any

00:02:20.434 --> 00:02:22.467
audible booing of jokes, yeah.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:23.901
I don't even think
we need to wait.

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:26.567
Let's just see the results.
This is gonna be a landslide.

00:02:26.567 --> 00:02:27.601
Yeah, okay.
[ Sad tuba ]

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:30.133
-Wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:31.734
Wow.
-Wow.

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:33.601
-Wow.

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:35.234
-Here we go.
This next one says...

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:42.767
-I'm gonna say
this one's gonna win.

00:02:42.767 --> 00:02:46.567
-"It's not connecting,
it needs ink.

00:02:46.567 --> 00:02:50.334
Uh, honey, do we need to make
any more CD-ROM labels?"

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:53.934
All right, here we go.
Let's see the results.

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:55.234
-Oh!
-Oh!

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:57.000
Squeaky, but very nice.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.334
♪♪

00:02:58.334 --> 00:03:00.267
You're being very nice tonight.
-Wow.

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.501
-You're being a very giving
audience tonight.

00:03:01.501 --> 00:03:03.834
I appreciate that.
We're down to our last one.

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:05.000
Here we go.
It says...

00:03:08.767 --> 00:03:09.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:11.667
Cast your vote.
This one...

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:13.934
I feel good -- I feel best
with this one.

00:03:13.934 --> 00:03:15.701
I think.
I don't know.

00:03:15.701 --> 00:03:17.267
All right.

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:18.734
I think everyone
cast their votes.

00:03:18.734 --> 00:03:20.501
We know if it's
gonna win or not.

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:23.267
Let's see the results here.

00:03:23.267 --> 00:03:25.667
Whoa!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:28.033
By far, by far!
Thank you!

00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:29.834
-Whoa!
-That was, by far, the winner!

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:32.400
I'm gonna post this
during the commercial break.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.133
If you see it on your feed,
give it a like,

00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:35.801
give it a "wetweet," and enjoy.

